#
# A wiring permit's fee in minor units, in Sutra (levin_rules.h LR5): the
# authority's base fee plus each inspection visit at its fee, exact. base
# fits 9(7), inspections 9(2) and visit 9(6); a value past its picture,
# or a negative, is a size error, and so is a fee past 9(8): an overflow,
# refused, never wrapped.
record wiring-permit
  base: 9(7)
  inspections: 9(2)
  visit: 9(6)
  fee: 9(8)
procedure
  compute fee = base + inspections * visit
  answer fee
